<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · island</p><h1 class="enc-title">Zhenbao Island</h1><p class="enc-meta">Also known as Damansky Island</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Zhenbao Island, known in Russian as Damansky Island, is a small island in the Ussuri River on the border between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/china">China</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/russia">Russia</a>. In March 1969 Chinese and Soviet troops fought deadly clashes there, the most serious episode of the Sino-Soviet border conflict, which brought the two powers close to war. The island was confirmed as Chinese in 1991.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/zhenbao-island.jpg" alt="Zhenbao Island" width="320" height="212" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: TowerCard · CC BY-SA 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E4%BB%8E%E9%AB%98%E5%A4%84%E4%BF%AF%E8%A7%86%E7%8F%8D%E5%AE%9D%E5%B2%9B_-_panoramio.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
